  "solution": {
    "text": "Since, distance <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math>&nbsp;is measured parallel to the line<br /><math><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></math> i.e. <math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> .<br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> Direction ratios of line <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math> are <math><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>5</mn></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0031_b3244a275c49.png\" style=\"width:1.72014in;height:1.38681in\" /><br />Equation of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>,</mo></math> (say)<br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> A point on the line is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1,4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2,5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>≡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math> , (say)<br />Point <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> lies on the plane <math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇔</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math> is the midpoint of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext>PQ</mtext></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext>PM</mtext></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext>PQ</mtext></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn></msqrt></math><br /><math><mo